# T1.3 (Amendment T §2.3): what the eyes rest on, highlighted by its own shape — a bilberry's
# berries alone and the bush itself, a raspberry's fruit at chest height, a hazel's branch, a
# stone and a stick lying, the patch of ground a dig would take, a point of water's surface.
# Never a box. Kept in docs/review/t1/ (as JPEGs).
